Did you try picking up the 1 and typing the day you were born?

Did you try picking up the 'A', rubbing it out, and then typing
the month you were born?

Well, by your Earth calendar I was born on January 29 (I won't say
which year) so I would pick up the 1, type backspace, '2', and '9' and then put the
29 back.  Then I'd pick up the 'A', type backspace, then type
"January", and then put it back.  I'd pick up the whole box with my
birthday in it.
